2026-09-11 09:20:52 EDT [CRAWLER] "We've all heard the common narrative of yield-chasing investors trapped in illiquid funds and advisors regretting a pitch they didn't understand," Cion Investments CEO Michael Reisner said. "It doesn't match reality, though."  
